<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK 2-WK REV REPO AVERAGE YIELD 14.49 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK 2-WK REV REPO AVERAGE YIELD 14.49 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Wednesday that average yield in a two-week reverse repo operation to drain liquidity was 14.49 percent versus 14.5 percent in a similar operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Minimum yield was 14.48 percent and maximum yield was 14.5 percent at which all bids were accepted.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>	  prague.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
